# Social Messaging App with Real-Time Notifications and Monetization

Below is a comprehensive code example for a social messaging app with real-time notifications and in-app monetization features. This implementation uses Node.js with Express for the backend, Socket.io for real-time communication, and MongoDB for data storage.

