# Interactive Stock Price Heatmap

Here's a minimal working version of an interactive stock price heatmap with real-time updates and zoom/pan functionality. This implementation uses HTML, CSS, and JavaScript with the following libraries:
- D3.js for data visualization
- Socket.IO for real-time updates (simulated in this example)

```html
