# Interactive Stock Price Heatmap

Here's a minimal working version of an interactive stock price heatmap with real-time updates and zoom/pan functionality using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript with the D3.js library.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stock Price Heatmap</title>
    <script src="https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .container {
