## Features

1. **Drag-and-Drop Task Management**:
   - Tasks can be dragged between columns
   - Tasks can be reordered within columns
   - Real-time updates when tasks are moved

2. **Real-time Collaboration**:
   - All changes are synchronized across all connected clients
   - Multiple users can work on the same board simultaneously

3. **User Authentication**:
