# Browser-Based Project Management Application

Here's an initial implementation of a project management application with drag-and-drop task boards and real-time collaboration features.

## Technology Stack
- Frontend: React.js with TypeScript
- Backend: Node.js with Express
- Real-time: Socket.io
- Database: MongoDB (with Mongoose)
- Drag-and-drop: react-beautiful-dnd

