## Setup Instructions

1. **Firebase Setup**:
   - Create a new project in the [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/)
   - Enable Authentication (Email/Password and Google providers)
   - Enable Firestore Database (in test mode for development)
   - Get your Firebase configuration object and replace the placeholder values in the JavaScript file

2. **Deployment**:
   - Host the files on any static web hosting service (Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages, etc.)
   - Make sure to configure the Firebase authentication domains in your Firebase project settings

3. **Features**:
   - Drag-and-drop task management between columns
   - Real-time collaboration (tasks sync across devices)
   - Task creation, editing, and deletion
   - Priority levels for tasks
   - User authentication (Google and email/password)

This minimal implementation provides the core functionality of a project management board. You can extend it with additional features like due dates, assignees, comments, or more detailed reporting as needed.

