# Ultra-Low-Latency Networking Service with Packet Filtering and Forwarding

Below is a C implementation of a high-performance networking service that performs packet-level filtering and forwarding with minimal latency. This example uses raw sockets and efficient data structures to minimize processing overhead.

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <string.h>
